 "answer": "The storage cost increases significantly when using 468 FFPs instead of 68. For the Celeb-DF(v2) dataset, the memory consumption rises from 2.65 GB for 68 FFPs to 18.3 GB for 468 FFPs. For the DF dataset, it increases from 0.4 GB to 7.5 GB [S2].",
